WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:08.170
The Expanse is a sci fi show about space,
politics, action, drama, lasagne, and ancient

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:09.570
alien mysteries.

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:13.650
It’s set in a future where humans have colonised
the solar system.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:18.940
Earth is the big old political power, run
by the United Nations.

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:23.539
Mars is a rival superpower, with advanced
technology and military.

00:00:23.539 --> 00:00:29.300
In the outer planets and the asteroid belt
are the Belters, living on the dangerous frontiers

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.880
of space.

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:36.170
Belters have their own culture and language,
and their bodies have adapted to low gravity.

00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:41.190
But the resources and wealth of the Belt is
still owned by the inner planets, Earth and

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:42.190
Mars.

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:47.359
A group called the OPA fight for Belter rights
and independence.

00:00:47.359 --> 00:00:53.499
So tensions are high between Earth, Mars and
the Belt – and a single spark could cause

00:00:53.499 --> 00:00:55.179
war.

00:00:55.179 --> 00:00:59.269
In Episode 1, Holden works on a ship called
the Canterbury.

00:00:59.269 --> 00:01:04.920
He used to be in the Earth space navy, now
he’s kinda slacking and avoiding responsibility,

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.850
and taking his shirt off a lot.

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:13.100
Naomi is an engineer from the Belt – she’s
smart and secretive about her past.

00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:15.500
Naomi is close with Amos.

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:20.700
Amos is weird – he’s emotionally detached,
and can be brutally violent.

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:26.170
But he can also be friendly and loyal, and
he tries to be a good man.

00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:31.359
Amos has a mysterious past involving organised
crime in Baltimore.

00:01:31.359 --> 00:01:37.530
Alex is pilot from Mars – he loves flying,
and cooks a mean space lasagne, and he left

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:40.700
a wife and child back on Mars.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:46.460
Holden Naomi Amos and Alex are the only survivors
when the Canterbury, and then a Martian ship,

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:49.590
are both mysteriously destroyed.

00:01:49.590 --> 00:01:53.110
Holden steps up as a leader to protect his
crew.

00:01:53.110 --> 00:01:59.310
They steal a Martian warship and name it Rocinante,
which is a reference to a story about a foolish

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:00.570
heroic knight.

00:02:00.570 --> 00:02:06.460
Cause Holden’s heroism is often impulsive
and naïve, and sometimes does more harm than

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:07.460
good.

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:12.360
Naomi becomes his voice of reason, helping
him make better choices – and they eventually

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:14.530
start a relationship.

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:19.410
The destruction of these ships sparks conflict
between Earth Mars and the Belt.

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:24.580
The Martians blow up the moon Phoebe, Earth
blows up the moon Deimos – and the system

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:27.260
hurtles towards all out war.

00:02:27.260 --> 00:02:32.780
With the help of OPA leader Fred Johnson,
the Roci crew investigate who started this

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:33.780
conflict.

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:37.390
Which leads them to Eros and Miller.

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:43.590
Miller is a washed-up beat-down cynical crooked
cop, who doesn’t really believe in anything

00:02:43.590 --> 00:02:44.590
anymore.

00:02:44.590 --> 00:02:48.750
But he investigates the disappearance of a
girl called Julie Mao.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:53.650
He learns that she rejected a life of wealth
and privilege to fight for the Belt with the

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:54.650
OPA.

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:59.890
She’s tough and determined and selfless,
and Miller comes to love her – without ever

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:03.840
having met her, almost like a religious faith.

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:09.610
Miller meets Holden and the crew on Eros,
and together they find Julie dead, infected

00:03:09.610 --> 00:03:13.260
with a mysterious alien virus called the protomolecule.

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:19.120
It turns out that Julie’s father, a powerful
businessman called Jules-Pierre, is secretly

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:22.210
experimenting with this protomolecule.

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:27.370
He had the Canterbury and the Martian ship
destroyed to deliberately spark war, as a

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:34.480
distraction so that he and his scientists
can infect everyone on Eros with the protomolecule.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:38.510
Julie tried to stop him, and just got infected
herself.

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:44.900
So Eros turns into a nightmare with this alien
contagion, and Holden and Miller work together

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:46.180
to escape.

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:51.780
Their personalities clash – cause Holden’s
an idealist who believes in peace truth and

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:57.730
justice – while Miller uses deception and
brutality to survive.

00:03:57.730 --> 00:04:01.230
They find Dresden, the scientist who infected
Eros.

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:04.090
And Miller kills him on the spot.

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:09.100
Holden is furious that Miller would execute
someone in cold blood, and kicks him out of

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:10.380
their crew.

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:16.959
But on Eros, the protomolecule is consuming
the bodies and minds of infected people, and

00:04:16.959 --> 00:04:19.490
seems to be “Building something”.

00:04:19.490 --> 00:04:21.130
Probably.. something bad.

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:24.720
So the crew make a plan to destroy Eros.

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:30.130
Fred has this giant Mormon spaceship called
the Nauvoo – and they plan to slam it into

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:32.280
Eros to knock into the sun.

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:39.880
But Eros inexplicably dodges the ship, seemingly
breaking the laws of physics, and speeds towards

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:40.880
Earth.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:46.500
So Miller goes into the heart of the infected
Eros, and finds Julie Mao.

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:52.050
This infection spread from her, and her consciousness
is part of the protomolecule.

00:04:52.050 --> 00:04:57.270
So he asks her to move Eros away from Earth
and to crash into Venus instead.

00:04:57.270 --> 00:05:03.090
Eros and Julie and Miller disappear into the
clouds, and Earth is saved.

00:05:03.090 --> 00:05:08.480
But while all these heroics are happening,
Avasarala deals with the politics.

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:13.370
Avasarala is one of the most powerful politicians
in the government of Earth.

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:18.950
In Season 1, she’s ruthless in stopping
OPA terrorism, and Martian aggression.

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:23.660
She tortures, and blackmails, and lies, and
betrays one of her close friends.

00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:28.400
Cause she believes that “Earth must come
first”, and will do anything to protect

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:30.210
her home and her family.

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:34.630
But she discovers that the conflict around
Eros weren’t caused by the Belt or Mars.

00:05:34.630 --> 00:05:39.889
There’s a conspiracy within her own government
on Earth, working with Jules-Pierre Mao to

00:05:39.889 --> 00:05:44.330
deliberately cause war and use the protomolecule
as a weapon.

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:47.690
Avasarala gets help from Bobbie.

00:05:47.690 --> 00:05:52.400
Bobbie is a Martian marine – a powerful
soldier loyal to Mars.

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:55.210
At first, she wants war with Earth.

00:05:55.210 --> 00:06:00.760
But on Ganymede, her squad gets wiped out
by a monstrous protomolecule creature.

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:05.080
And she discovers that her own government
was behind this – Jules-Pierre secretly

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:09.710
works with Mars as well as Earth to weaponise
the protomolecule.

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:16.470
His scientists experiment on children, transforming
them into these hybrid protomolecule “killing

00:06:16.470 --> 00:06:17.470
machines”.

00:06:17.470 --> 00:06:22.800
So Bobbie leaves the Martians, and goes all
Iron Man to defend Avasarala, and works with

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:26.010
the Roci crew to fight the conspiracy.

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:30.620
These people from Earth Mars and the Belt
settle their differences and come together

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:31.870
as a team.

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:36.430
Amos makes friends with a botanist called
Prax and helps him save his daughter.

00:06:36.430 --> 00:06:40.490
Naomi and Alex save Mars from protomolecule
missiles.

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:43.880
Bobbie kills a hybrid to avenge her squad.

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:46.770
And Holden arrests Jules-Pierre Mao.

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:50.060
The evil conspiracy is ended.

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:53.850
But on Venus, the protomolecule from Eros
has been busy.

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:59.800
When a science ship investigates, the protomolecule
disassembles the ship, and poor Adam Savage

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:01.020
asphyxiates.

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:06.180
The protomolecule is intelligent and powerful
and purposeful.

00:07:06.180 --> 00:07:12.110
In Season 3, it emerges from Venus and forms
a mysterious Ring, which seems to be like

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:13.740
a wormhole.

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:19.040
So Earth and Mars and the Belt send ships
to investigate, including the Rocinante.

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:23.110
Holden and the crew are sued by Mars for stealing
their ship.

00:07:23.110 --> 00:07:28.550
So a journalist called Monica pays their legal
fees, and in return she films them for a documentary.

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:31.090
But Naomi isn’t with them.

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:36.740
She loves Holden Amos and Alex, but she also
loves her people, the Belters.

00:07:36.740 --> 00:07:41.120
So she joins her friend Drummer on the OPA
ship Behemoth.

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:45.590
The Behemoth was originally the Nauvoo, that
giant Mormon spaceship.

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:49.880
But after it was launched it at Eros, Fred
and Drummer converted it into a giant OPA

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:51.280
warship called the Behemoth.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:58.090
It represents the hope for a Belter nation,
and of the OPA as a real political power.

00:07:58.090 --> 00:08:00.690
Drummer captains the Behemoth at the Ring.

00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:07.190
But she has to contend with Ashford, an OPA
pirate who would rather control the ship himself.

00:08:07.190 --> 00:08:10.910
And there’s a greater threat from Clarissa
Mao.

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:16.220
Clarissa is the eldest daughter of Jules-Pierre
Mao, the businessman behind the protomolecule

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:17.310
conspiracy.

00:08:17.310 --> 00:08:23.130
When her father is jailed and shamed for his
crimes, Clarissa wants revenge on Holden.

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:27.930
So she flies to the Ring as a maintenance
worker, and she blows up a ship, and uses

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:32.469
like a.. deepfake video to frame Holden for
her crime.

00:08:32.469 --> 00:08:36.869
The Behemoth attacks the Roci, so they escape
into the Ring.

00:08:36.869 --> 00:08:42.759
And inside the Ring is a mysterious space
where an alien force prevents anything from

00:08:42.759 --> 00:08:49.970
going above a certain speed, which prevents
ships from attacking each other.

00:08:49.970 --> 00:08:53.779
And Holden has weird visions of Miller.

00:08:53.779 --> 00:08:56.480
Miller died when Eros crashed into Venus.

00:08:56.480 --> 00:09:02.069
But the protomolecule incorporated Miller’s
consciousness into itself, and uses him to

00:09:02.069 --> 00:09:04.240
communicate with Holden.

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:09.970
This Miller leads Holden to a mysterious station
at the centre of the Ring.

00:09:09.970 --> 00:09:13.819
And Holden has visions of the ancient past.

00:09:13.819 --> 00:09:19.290
He learns that Ring was built by a powerful
alien civilisation called the Builders.

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:24.329
The Builders created the protomolecule – not
as a weapon, but as a tool to build these

00:09:24.329 --> 00:09:25.329
Ring gates.

00:09:25.329 --> 00:09:31.759
But aeons ago, the Builders were destroyed
by some mysterious other aliens.

00:09:31.759 --> 00:09:38.589
This ghost of Miller is the Builders’ technology
trying to learn what happened to its creators.

00:09:38.589 --> 00:09:43.399
Some Martians attack Holden, and the Ring
sees them as a threat, so it suddenly lowers

00:09:43.399 --> 00:09:50.749
the speed limit – which instantly decelerates
all the ships in the space, killing or injuring

00:09:50.749 --> 00:09:51.749
thousands.

00:09:51.749 --> 00:09:56.920
Drummer and Ashford get trapped under a tractor
– they spend some quality time, and squash

00:09:56.920 --> 00:09:59.290
their beef – and their legs.

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:03.089
But Naomi builds Drummer some robot legs so
it’s all good.

00:10:03.089 --> 00:10:06.459
But these injured people are a disaster.

00:10:06.459 --> 00:10:11.089
Because ships in The Expanse create gravity
by constantly accelerating with their thrusters

00:10:11.089 --> 00:10:17.670
– like how you’re pushed back in your
seat when you accelerate a car, but constantly.

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:21.529
With the Ring’s speed limit, they can’t
accelerate to make gravity.

00:10:21.529 --> 00:10:26.220
Which means the injured people can’t heal,
cause blood doesn’t drain right in zero

00:10:26.220 --> 00:10:27.220
G.

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:33.320
But the Behemoth has another way to make gravity
– it can spin, creating gravity by centrifugal

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:34.320
force.

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:39.179
So Ashford invites all the injured Earthers
and Martians to the Behemoth to heal – it’s

00:10:39.179 --> 00:10:45.499
a show of strength and compassion and reconciliation
from the new Belter nation.

00:10:45.499 --> 00:10:47.170
Naomi returns to the Rocinante.

00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:49.610
Cause she’s loyal to the Belters.

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:52.430
But the Roci crew are her family.

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:58.149
Clarissa tries to kill Holden, and attacks
Naomi, but she’s saved by Anna.

00:10:58.149 --> 00:11:04.529
Anna is a pastor, and on the Ring, she offers
compassion and comfort to the scared and injured.

00:11:04.529 --> 00:11:09.249
She offers some guidance to Amos, and helps
convince Clarissa to cool it with all the

00:11:09.249 --> 00:11:12.540
murdering and to seek redemption instead.

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:18.230
Everyone’s still stuck in the Ring space,
so Ashford tries destroying the Ring.

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:23.550
The Ring gets fed up with humanity, and starts
charging its weapons to wipe out the entire

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:26.850
solar system like a bloody Halo ring.

00:11:26.850 --> 00:11:32.220
Holden has a better plan, and fights Ashford’s
men for control of the Behemoth.

00:11:32.220 --> 00:11:37.680
With the heroism of the Roci crew, Drummer,
Bobbie, Anna, and even Clarissa, they defeat

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:42.529
Ashford, and shut down all their ships, to
show the Ring they’re not a threat.

00:11:42.529 --> 00:11:49.879
The Ring chills out, and reveals its true
purpose – it opens a thousand new gates,

00:11:49.879 --> 00:11:53.949
wormholes to distant star systems with habitable
worlds.

00:11:53.949 --> 00:12:00.509
These are thousands of new opportunities for
land and resources and freedom, so in Season

00:12:00.509 --> 00:12:04.839
4, humanity ventures into new worlds.

00:12:04.839 --> 00:12:10.019
Earth Mars and the Belt are at peace, and
Avasarala becomes the Secretary General of

00:12:10.019 --> 00:12:12.889
the United Nations, governing Earth.

00:12:12.889 --> 00:12:17.851
Some Belters go through the Ring and settle
a planet called Ilus, where they discover

00:12:17.851 --> 00:12:22.899
some mysterious alien protomolecule-lookin
structures.

00:12:22.899 --> 00:12:25.339
So Holden and the crew investigate.

00:12:25.339 --> 00:12:30.990
They land on the alien planet, and Naomi walks
under a sky for the first time.

00:12:30.990 --> 00:12:36.860
As a Belter, she grew up in low gravity, so
this planet is hell on her body – so she

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:39.810
and Alex stay in the Roci in orbit.

00:12:39.810 --> 00:12:45.230
On Ilus, Holden tries to make peace between
the Belter settlers and an Earth corporation

00:12:45.230 --> 00:12:47.689
who want the planet for themselves.

00:12:47.689 --> 00:12:51.540
Their leader Murtry kills some Belters and
calls them terrorists.

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:58.389
He’s a brute, but he’s not all wrong – some
of the Belters do blow up a ship full of people

00:12:58.389 --> 00:13:01.579
in their desperation to keep their new home.

00:13:01.579 --> 00:13:04.269
Holden investigates the alien structures.

00:13:04.269 --> 00:13:09.610
The ghost of Miller leads him to reactivate
some billion year old alien machinery, which

00:13:09.610 --> 00:13:15.079
malfunctions and explodes, sending a massive
tsunami at their settlement, and disabling

00:13:15.079 --> 00:13:16.350
their ships.

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:21.220
They take cover in one of the structures,
but it’s full of deadly alien slugs, and

00:13:21.220 --> 00:13:26.019
everyone except Holden goes blind from an
infection, and they’re running out of food.

00:13:26.019 --> 00:13:27.970
It’s a really shitty time.

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:33.009
So Miller guides Holden to a mysterious ancient
weapon.

00:13:33.009 --> 00:13:37.660
Billions of years ago, the Builders, who created
these structures and Rings and the protomolecule,

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:42.989
were destroyed by some other aliens using
these weapons.

00:13:42.989 --> 00:13:48.029
Miller puts himself into a body, and steps
into the weapon, to disable all the alien

00:13:48.029 --> 00:13:51.449
tech on the planet, and to destroy himself.

00:13:51.449 --> 00:13:57.360
So the tortured ghost of Miller is finally
put to rest, and the planet is safe.

00:13:57.360 --> 00:14:02.949
Holden has a Western showdown with Murtry,
and captures him – rejecting his lawless

00:14:02.949 --> 00:14:09.069
brutal wild west ethos in favour of peace,
justice, and due process.

00:14:09.069 --> 00:14:14.319
Amos has a relationship with one of Murtry’s
soldiers, and she forces him to choose between

00:14:14.319 --> 00:14:19.579
her and Murtry or the Roci crew – he chooses
the Roci.

00:14:19.579 --> 00:14:24.470
Alex and Naomi pull some smart moves to keep
their ships in the air, including using a

00:14:24.470 --> 00:14:26.259
rail gun as a thruster.

00:14:26.259 --> 00:14:30.860
They protect a Belter who was a terrorist
but was nice about it.

00:14:30.860 --> 00:14:35.920
And a scientist called Elvi gets to study
the remaining alien artefacts.

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:42.259
So the crew save Ilus, but the alien technology
a mystery.

00:14:42.259 --> 00:14:45.720
On Earth, Avasarala fights a political battle.

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:49.869
She’s challenged in an election by a rival,
Nancy Gao.

00:14:49.869 --> 00:14:55.920
And Avasarala pulls some dirty tricks to try
to win – she leaks and lies and orders a

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:59.239
military strike that ends up killing civilians.

00:14:59.239 --> 00:15:04.910
In the end, Avasarala loses the election,
and her husband Arjun leaves cause she put

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:09.680
politics and pride ahead of her morals and
family.

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:14.860
Without Arjun, and without her power, who
is Avasarala now?

00:15:14.860 --> 00:15:20.449
On Mars, Bobbie gets kicked out of the military
for disobeying orders to go save the world

00:15:20.449 --> 00:15:21.449
so many times.

00:15:21.449 --> 00:15:24.550
And life on Mars is kinda depressing now.

00:15:24.550 --> 00:15:30.480
Martians worked together for generations to
terraform the red planet into a habitable

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:31.480
world.

00:15:31.480 --> 00:15:36.069
But now that there are thousands of already
habitable planets beyond the Ring, Mars is..

00:15:36.069 --> 00:15:39.189
kinda pointless, people leave.

00:15:39.189 --> 00:15:44.410
Bobbie believed in the Martian dream, but
now the dream is dying.

00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:47.999
And her new boyf who buys her waffles leaves
as well.

00:15:47.999 --> 00:15:52.730
So Bobbie gets involved with criminals who
steal Martian technology and sell it on the

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:54.050
black market.

00:15:54.050 --> 00:16:00.480
It seems harmless at first, but she discovers
that it’s linked to a dangerous conspiracy.

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:06.910
In the Ring, the OPA ship Behemoth is renamed
to Medina Station – it’s the hub of the

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:10.910
new Belter nation, and the gateway to the
worlds beyond the Ring.

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:16.100
It’s run by Ashford and Drummer, and they
learn that peace is hard.

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:21.579
They try to cooperate with Earth and Mars,
but many Belters still hate the inner planets.

00:16:21.579 --> 00:16:26.509
There are attacks by a Belter extremist called
Marco Inaros.

00:16:26.509 --> 00:16:30.730
Back in the day, Naomi had a son with Marco,
called Filip.

00:16:30.730 --> 00:16:35.459
Naomi left Marco because she didn’t want
to be involved in Marco’s terrorism, and

00:16:35.459 --> 00:16:44.859
Naomi hasn’t seen her son since.

00:16:44.859 --> 00:16:49.650
Marco believes that peace between Belters
and the inner planets is impossible, and they

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:52.209
need to fight for their future.

00:16:52.209 --> 00:16:57.609
So Marco plans a terrible attack, using Bobbie’s
stolen Martian technology.

00:16:57.609 --> 00:17:03.439
He gets an asteroid, and paints it with Martian
stealth tech, and launches it towards Earth.

00:17:03.439 --> 00:17:10.089
This could kill billions of people, and with
the stealth tech, they won’t see it coming.

00:17:10.089 --> 00:17:12.559
So will Earth be saved?

00:17:12.559 --> 00:17:15.500
Will Bobbie uncover a Martian conspiracy?

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:16.500
Will Holden discover the mysteries of the
alien Builders?

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:18.510
Will Naomi reunite with Marco and Filip?

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:21.260
Will Alex and Amos make peace with their pasts?

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:28.329
